From f732a458a95aea82520d5a9eaacdb5e62e6f1149 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: claude-brain <build@claude-brain.invalid>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 06:03:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] registry: add gpt-6-astra to the codex team/plus/pro catalogs

Backport of upstream c77b1369 ('feat(models): add gpt-6-astra model'),
restricted to the embedded registry catalog and rebased onto the pinned
commit. claude-brain runs the proxy with --local-model, so a model that is
absent from the embedded catalog is never registered and every request for
it fails with 'unknown provider for model gpt-6-astra'.

Only models.json is touched: codex_client_models.json supplies display
templates for Codex clients and falls back to the default template for an
unknown id, which is correct for astra.

Tier membership matches upstream exactly: team, plus and pro, not free.
